OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has arrived
OL,8,Fin Dublin for the start of his two-day
OL,9,Fvisit to the Republic of Ireland
OL,11,FThe president says the US and Ireland's
OL,12,Frelationship has never been so good as
OL,13,Fhe speaks to the media alongside
OL,14,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,15,FMicheal Martin
OL,17,FAsked about the prospect of a unified
OL,18,FIreland, Trump says he doesn't want to
OL,19,Fcause any problems but he'd "love to
OL,20,Fsee it unified"
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
