OL,3,GNEWSADonald Trump says unified Ireland
OL,4,Awould be a 'great thing' as he meets
OL,5,AIrish prime minister
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was earlier greeted by a military
OL,8,Fguard of honour as he met with Irish
OL,9,FPresident Catherine Connolly at her
OL,10,Fofficial residence in Phoenix Park
OL,12,FHe will later travel to his golf resort
OL,13,Fin Doonbeg, County Clare, where the
OL,14,FIrish Open golf tournament is being
OL,15,Fheld
OL,17,FIrish authorities have been planning
OL,18,Ffor Trump's visit for months in what
OL,19,Fwill be one of the biggest security
OL,20,Foperations in the history of the state
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
